msgstr "Over Auto Focus Keyword for SEO"

#: admin/views/settings.view.php:27
#: premium/auto-focus-keyword-for-seo-premium/admin/views/settings.view.php:15
msgid ""
"The Automatic Focus keyword for SEO plugin will add automatically \"focus "
"keywords\" on the backend, for websites using Yoast SEO, Rank Math, "
"SEOPress, or All in One SEO plugins, to all your pages, based on post titles "
"(used for each of these pages) so that you can optimize your content using "
"their dynamic live settings (meta title, meta description, slug, alt "
"tags, ...) for SEO. Please refer to the FAQ section to learn about all these "
"terms (Focus Keyword, Meta tag Keyword, etc.). Once done, you will be able "
"to use several other plugins made by Pagup.com to automatically optimize Alt "
"tags, Title tags, Internal links and more ... (as these plugins are based on "
"these Focus keywords). Enjoy !"
msgstr ""
"De plugin Automatic Focus Keyword for SEO voegt automatisch \"focus "
"keywords\" toe in de backend, voor websites die Yoast SEO, Rank Math, "
"SEOPress of All in One SEO gebruiken, aan al je pagina’s op basis van "
"berichttitels. Zo kun je je content optimaliseren met hun dynamische "
"instellingen, zoals meta title, meta description, slug, alt-tags en meer. "
"Raadpleeg de FAQ om meer te leren over deze termen. Daarna kun je andere "
"plugins van Pagup.com gebruiken om automatisch alt-tags, title-tags, interne "
"links en meer te optimaliseren, omdat deze plugins op deze focus keywords "
"steunen. Veel succes!"

#: admin/views/settings.view.php:31
#: premium/auto-focus-keyword-for-seo-premium/admin/views/settings.view.php:17
msgid ""
"PS: we strongly recommend that you do not use Yoast SEO, Rank Math, "
"SEOPress, and All in One SEO plugins altogether (for compatibility matters)."
msgstr ""
"PS: we raden sterk af om Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress en All in One SEO "
"tegelijk te gebruiken, om compatibiliteitsredenen."

